Redis
.It is an in-memory data store that clients communicate with over a network.
.client sends a command ex PING(also used to check whether the redis server is healthy)
.Redis server process it
.server send back response ex PONG
.Redis client communicate with redis server by sending commands

TCP(Transmission Control Protocol)
.A program that waits for clients, accept their connection, receives their data, and sends a response
It make sure
.data reaches the destination
.data arrives in correct order
.lost data can be sent again
.a connection is established before communication

Socket
.A socket is a programming interface to the network communication
(ServerSocket serverSocket = new ServerSocket(port))
.ServerSocket listen for new TCP connection
.A Socket communicates over an established connection with a particular client
.new ServerSocket(port) - creates a server socket and binds it to the specific port as part of the constructor

